   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Saw Gener Cryin' In His Sleep**: back after 254 archived shows (3032 days) [4]\n- **Mister Richard Smoker**: back after 43 archived shows (612 days) [4]\n- **Polka Dot Tail**: back after 59 archived shows (715 days) [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **weeen2009-07-09.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 33 songs; 150 min [1]\n- **ween2009-07-09.schoeps.flacf**: source not stated; 33 songs; 150 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **weeen2009-07-09.flac16**: taped by fUNKYbret; source: Peluso CEMC6-CK4 > XLR > Edirol R-4 (24/44) [1]\n- **ween2009-07-09.schoeps.flacf**: taped by Andy Murray; transferred by Andy Murray; source: Schoeps MK41>KC5>CMC6>Sonosax SX-M2>Apogee Mini-me(aes out at 24bit/96khz)>COAX>Edirol R-44 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by D.King Gallery: [Todd Slater Ween Poster](https://www.dking-gallery.com/store/SLA_WeenMelt.html) [5]\n- Poster by Concertposterauction.com: [Ween Providence RI 2009 Todd Slater S/N 7/10 SILVER Silkscreen Poster](https://concertposterauction.com/Listing/Details/682844/Ween-Providence-RI-2009-Todd-Slater-SN-710-SILVER-Silkscreen-Poster) [6]",
